@startuml breadpan-startup
participant 消费方
participant breadpan
participant "D-Bus 会话总线" as bus
participant "存量 Item" as item

消费方 -> breadpan: start()
breadpan -> bus: 申请 Watcher 名 + 订阅变更 / 死亡清理信号
breadpan -> item: 反向发现（ListNames 扫描 + 探测）
item --> breadpan: 存量 Item
breadpan -> breadpan: 内部处理（登记最小集、现场读取、组装快照）
breadpan --> 消费方: (Handle, 事件通道)
@enduml
